9436,147],["κατοικοῦσιν",707534,349],["Γαλααδ",702920,114]],"And the people the princes of Galaad said every man to his neighbour, Who [is] he that shall begin to fight against the children of Ammon? he shall even be head over all that dwell in Galaad."]]